                                                "sense_id": "fc86df04-0fe0-3344-b7a5-973dd77136a1",
                                                "text": "And that you'd guide me to your Soueraignes Court,"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a1b34137-fc1a-44c0-8cf4-2c29ddc9ce9f",
                                                "sense_id": "fc86df04-0fe0-3344-b7a5-973dd77136a1",
                                                "text": "Kolyat: I brought a prayer book, Commander. Would you care to join me?\nKolyat: Kalahira, this one's heart is pure, but beset by wickedness and contention.\nShepard: Guide this one to where the traveler never tires, the lover never leaves, the hungry never starve.\nShepard: Guide this one, Kalahira, and she will be a companion to you as she was to me."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
